<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script src="./support.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="" />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300;1,400&family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
doc-page:not(:defined){visibility:hidden}
body{margin:0}
a{color:#0E1113;text-decoration:none}
a:hover{color:#8E8688}
</style>
<script src="./doc-page.js"></script>
</helmet>
<doc-page size="letter">

<section class="page" data-screen-label="01 Cover" style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0.72in 0.8in 0.6in;background:#0E1113;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;overflow:hidden">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:#14181A"></div>
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.035) 0 1px,transparent 1px 9px)"></div>
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0.28in;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.10)"></div>
  <sc-if value="{{ showPlaceholderLabels }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
    <div style="position:absolute;left:50%;top:32%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);text-align:center;font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:0.14em;line-height:2;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.42)">IMAGE PLACEHOLDER<br />FULL BLEED MOUNTAIN ARCHITECTURE, DIMMED TOWARD CHARCOAL<br />300 DPI, 8.75 x 11.25 IN WITH BLEED</div>
  </sc-if>
  <div style="position:relative;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72)">Aperture Global</div>
  <div style="position:relative;flex:1"></div>
  <h1 style="position:relative;margin:0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:300;font-size:58px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-0.012em;max-width:7.6em;text-wrap:pretty">Your home, placed in front of the <em style="font-style:italic;font-weight:300">right audience.</em></h1>
  <div style="position:relative;width:56px;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.32);margin:38px 0 26px"></div>
  <div style="position:relative;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.62)">Digital Campaign Report</div>
  <div style="position:relative;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:0.01em;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92)">141 Ulreys Lake Road, Big Sky, Montana</div>
  <div style="position:relative;margin-top:9px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.52)">July 14 through August 14, 2025</div>
  <div style="position:relative;flex:0.42"></div>
  <div style="position:relative;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55)">Apertureglobal.com</div>
</section>

<section class="page" data-screen-label="02 The Approach" style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0.78in 0.85in 0.55in;background:#F7F6F3;color:#0E1113;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;overflow:hidden">
  <div style="font-size:10.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">The Approach</div>
  <h2 style="margin:56px 0 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:300;font-size:52px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.012em">Precision over <em style="font-style:italic;font-weight:300">volume.</em></h2>
  <p style="margin:44px 0 0;max-width:26em;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.9;color:#3A3E41;text-wrap:pretty">Your home is not advertised everywhere. It is advertised where it matters. Over a thirty day flight, Aperture Global placed your residence before a curated digital audience of qualified buyers across the markets most likely to produce them. Every placement is selected, not scattered. The result is a campaign that reflects the caliber of the home it represents.</p>
  <div style="height:1px;background:#E3DAD1;margin:58px 0 0"></div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.1in 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:baseline;padding:30px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1">
      <div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Targeted Feeder Markets</div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.75;color:#3A3E41">Nine markets chosen for their record of producing Montana buyers.</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.1in 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:baseline;padding:30px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1">
      <div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Curated Digital Reach</div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.75;color:#3A3E41">Premium placements only, sized and styled for the home they present.</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.1in 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:baseline;padding:30px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1">
      <div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Measured Results</div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.75;color:#3A3E41">Every impression, viewer, and engagement accounted for and reported.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="flex:1"></div>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">
    <span>Campaign Report · The Approach</span>
    <span>Apertureglobal.com</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page" data-screen-label="03 Performance" style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0.78in 0.85in 0.55in;background:#0E1113;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;overflow:hidden">
  <div style="font-size:10.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">Campaign Performance</div>
  <h2 style="margin:56px 0 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:300;font-size:52px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.012em;color:#FFFFFF">Thirty days, <em style="font-style:italic;font-weight:300">measured.</em></h2>
  <div style="height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);margin:52px 0 0"></div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:34px 0 30px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14)">
      <div style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:300;font-size:96px;line-height:0.86;letter-spacing:-0.02em">46,663</div>
      <div style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688;padding-bottom:6px">Impressions Delivered</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:34px 0 30px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14)">
      <div style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:300;font-size:96px;line-height:0.86;letter-spacing:-0.02em">33,670</div>
      <div style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688;padding-bottom:6px">Unique Viewers Reached</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:34px 0 30px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14)">
      <div style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:300;font-size:96px;line-height:0.86;letter-spacing:-0.02em">70%</div>
      <div style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688;padding-bottom:6px">Viewability Rate</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p style="margin:44px 0 0;max-width:30em;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-wrap:pretty">Over its thirty day flight, your home was presented more than forty-six thousand times to a curated audience of nearly thirty-four thousand qualified viewers, with seven in ten placements confirmed as seen. Engagement ran above typical benchmarks for digital property campaigns, with a 0.21 percent click-through rate.</p>
  <div style="flex:1"></div>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">
    <span>Campaign Report · Performance</span>
    <span>Apertureglobal.com</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page" data-screen-label="04 Geographic Reach" style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0.72in 0.6in 0.55in;background:#F7F6F3;color:#0E1113;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;overflow:hidden">
  <div style="font-size:10.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">Geographic Reach</div>
  <h2 style="margin:40px 0 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:300;font-size:42px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.012em;max-width:14em">The right buyers live in the <em style="font-style:italic;font-weight:300">right places.</em></h2>
  <p style="margin:28px 0 0;max-width:34em;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.85;color:#3A3E41;text-wrap:pretty">A Big Sky residence sells to buyers from beyond Big Sky. Your campaign concentrated on the nation's proven feeder markets for Montana luxury property, the cities where discerning buyers already live, alongside the mountain west communities that know this landscape best.</p>
  <div style="height:1px;background:#E3DAD1;margin:30px 0 0"></div>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2.75in;gap:0.34in;margin-top:30px;align-items:start">
    <div style="position:relative">
      <img src="assets/north-america.svg" alt="Map of North America" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;opacity:0.85" />
      <sc-if value="{{ showMapLabels }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
        <div style="position:absolute;inset:0">
          <div style="position:absolute;left:14.59%;top:17.09%;width:0;height:0"><div style="position:absolute;left:-2.5px;top:-2.5px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#B2C6D6"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:9px;top:-4px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">British Columbia</div></div>
          <div style="position:absolute;left:26.96%;top:31.5%;width:0;height:0"><div style="position:absolute;left:-3.5px;top:-3.5px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#0E1113"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:11px;top:-4px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Montana</div></div>
          <div style="position:absolute;left:25.1%;top:43.1%;width:0;height:0"><div style="position:absolute;left:-2.5px;top:-2.5px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#B2C6D6"></div><div style="position:absolute;right:9px;top:-4px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Utah</div></div>
          <div style="position:absolute;left:33.95%;top:47.28%;width:0;height:0"><div style="position:absolute;left:-2.5px;top:-2.5px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#B2C6D6"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:9px;top:-4px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Colorado</div></div>
          <div style="position:absolute;left:14.42%;top:58.19%;width:0;height:0"><div style="position:absolute;left:-2.5px;top:-2.5px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#B2C6D6"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:9px;top:-4px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">California</div></div>
          <div style="position:absolute;left:56.57%;top:41.05%;width:0;height:0"><div style="position:absolute;left:-2.5px;top:-2.5px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#B2C6D6"></div><div style="position:absolute;right:9px;top:-4px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Illinois</div></div>
          <div style="position:absolute;left:74.35%;top:39.3%;width:0;height:0"><div style="position:absolute;left:-2.5px;top:-2.5px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#B2C6D6"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:9px;top:-4px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">New York</div></div>
          <div style="position:absolute;left:58.85%;top:55.86%;width:0;height:0"><div style="position:absolute;left:-2.5px;top:-2.5px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#B2C6D6"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:9px;top:2px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Tennessee</div></div>
          <div style="position:absolute;left:71.32%;top:80.55%;width:0;height:0"><div style="position:absolute;left:-2.5px;top:-2.5px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#B2C6D6"></div><div style="position:absolute;left:9px;top:-4px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Florida</div></div>
        </div>
      </sc-if>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;column-gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding-bottom:9px;border-bottom:1px solid #0E1113;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">
        <span>Market</span><span style="text-align:right">Impressions</span><span style="text-align:right;min-width:52px">Unique Viewers</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;column-gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113"><span>New York</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">14,284</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:52px">10,725</span></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;column-gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113"><span>California</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">10,045</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:52px">6,568</span></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;column-gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113"><span>Illinois</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">8,036</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:52px">5,852</span></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;column-gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113"><span>Colorado</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">6,683</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:52px">5,024</span></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;column-gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113"><span>Utah</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">2,838</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:52px">1,989</span></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;column-gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113"><span>Florida</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">2,507</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:52px">1,824</span></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;column-gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113"><span>Tennessee</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">1,094</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:52px">862</span></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;column-gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113"><span>Montana</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">624</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:52px">413</span></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;column-gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113"><span>British Columbia</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">326</span><span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:52px">262</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p style="margin:34px 0 0;max-width:32em;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.85;color:#3A3E41">Reach extended internationally into British Columbia, where engagement ran strongest of any market.</p>
  <div style="flex:1"></div>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #E3DAD1;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">
    <span>Campaign Report · Geographic Reach</span>
    <span>Apertureglobal.com</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page" data-screen-label="05 Engagement" style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0.78in 0.85in 0.55in;background:#F7F6F3;color:#0E1113;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;overflow:hidden">
  <div style="font-size:10.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">Engagement</div>
  <h2 style="margin:52px 0 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:300;font-size:52px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.012em">Interest where it <em style="font-style:italic;font-weight:300">counts.</em></h2>
  <p style="margin:40px 0 0;max-width:28em;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.9;color:#3A3E41;text-wrap:pretty">Engagement tells you where a home resonates. The strongest response to your residence came from the mountain west, the buyers who already understand what Big Sky offers.</p>
  <div style="height:1px;background:#E3DAD1;margin:54px 0 0"></div>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:16px 0 30px;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">
    <span>Click Through Rate by Market</span>
    <span>Top Engaging Regions</span>
  </div>
  <div style="color:#B2C6D6;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5in 1fr 0.5in;gap:14px;align-items:center"><span style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">British Columbia</span><span style="display:block;height:9px;width:88%;background:currentColor"></span><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">0.92%</span></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5in 1fr 0.5in;gap:14px;align-items:center"><span style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Colorado</span><span style="display:block;height:9px;width:31.6%;background:currentColor"></span><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">0.33%</span></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5in 1fr 0.5in;gap:14px;align-items:center"><span style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Utah</span><span style="display:block;height:9px;width:26.8%;background:currentColor"></span><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">0.28%</span></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5in 1fr 0.5in;gap:14px;align-items:center"><span style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Tennessee</span><span style="display:block;height:9px;width:25.8%;background:currentColor"></span><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">0.27%</span></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5in 1fr 0.5in;gap:14px;align-items:center"><span style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">Florida</span><span style="display:block;height:9px;width:23%;background:currentColor"></span><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">0.24%</span></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5in 1fr 0.5in;gap:14px;align-items:center"><span style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E1113">California</span><span style="font-size:9px;display:block;height:9px;width:18.2%;background:currentColor"></span><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:#0E1113;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">0.19%</span></div>
