  <p style="margin:40px 0 0;max-width:28em;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-wrap:pretty">Your residence appeared in six tailored formats designed for desktop, mobile, and tablet, so the home presented beautifully wherever a buyer encountered it. Larger editorial placements carried the reach. Immersive full screen formats drew the strongest response.</p>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0.6in;margin-top:62px">
