      <div style="margin-top:20px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">Peak Format Viewability</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:74px">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.9in 1.1in 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688"><span>Format Family</span><span>Role</span><span>In This Campaign</span></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.9in 1.1in 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase"><span>Editorial Display</span><span style="color:#8E8688">Reach</span><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72)">Carried the majority of impressions</span></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.9in 1.1in 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase"><span>Standard Banner</span><span style="color:#8E8688">Presence</span><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72)">Held the home in steady rotation</span></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.9in 1.1in 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase"><span>Immersive Full Screen</span><span style="color:#8E8688">Engagement</span><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72)">Drew the strongest response</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="flex:1"></div>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);font-size:9px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8E8688">
    <span>Campaign Report · Creative Delivery</span>
